  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LEN Skatteseminarier</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LEN Taxseminars</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xE4;r att genom kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring inom skatteomr&#xE5;det ge st&#xF6;d till utvecklingen av den regionala skattemyndigheten i Leningrad oblast. Ett femdagarsseminarium i Leningrad och ett studiebes&#xF6;k f&#xF6;r ryska representanter till V&#xE4;ster&#xE5;s kommer att organiseras. Svensk samarbetspartner &#xE4;r Riksskatteverket/skattemyndigheten i V&#xE4;ster&#xE5;s.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim is to by transfer of swedish know-how in the field of taxation provide support to the development of the Regional Tax Authority in Leningrad oblast. A five-day seminar in Leningrad and a study visit for russian representatives in V&#xE4;ster&#xE5;s will be  organized. Swedish counterpart is Riksskattevreket/skattemynd i V-&#xE5;s.</narrative>
  </description>
